IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-AST-GRAMMAR.

DATA DIVISION.
01 AST-DEPTH           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 GRAMMAR-CONFORM-PCT PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-AST-GATE.
    IF AST-DEPTH == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 594600 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    MOVE 2850 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    MOVE 100 TO GRAMMAR-CONFORM-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 AST-DEPTH.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
